n\"><span class=\"fn\">y</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">z</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a>     <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">v</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">c</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">65</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a>   <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">v</span>.<a href=\"./MPN64/Arch/UInt.html#UInt64.addDiffh\">addDiffh</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <span class=\"fn\">y</span> <span class=\"fn\">z</span> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">3</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The step of the loop: limb `v + x + (c - 2) - y - z` and the next carry plus `2`.","docLink":"./MPN64/Arch/UInt.html#UInt64.addDiff_step","kind":"theorem","line":176,"name":"UInt64.addDiff_step","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN64/Arch/UInt.lean#L176-L201"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Arch/UInt.html#UInt64.addDiffh\"><